Alembic migrations for data/training.db (config: alembic.ini at the repo root, DB path from TRAINING_DB_PATH).

  uv run alembic upgrade head
  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."

Do NOT add an __init__.py to this directory: it would turn it into a regular package named `alembic`
that shadows the installed alembic library (`from alembic import context` in env.py).
